      "level": 2,
      "content": "16.1 Sports"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Odisha hosted the FIH Men's Hockey World Cup consecutively in 2018 (Bhubaneswar) and 2023 (Bhubaneswar and Rourkela).",
        "The Biju Patnaik Sports Award is the highest state honor for excellence in sports, coaching, and sports journalism in Odisha.",
        "Dilip Tirkey, former national hockey captain, serves as a pioneering sports figure and President of Hockey India.",
        "Pramod Bhagat from Odisha won India's first-ever Paralympic Gold Medal in Badminton at the 2020 Tokyo Paralympics.",
        "The Ekalabya Puraskar is awarded annually to outstanding young sportspersons of Odisha by the IMPaCT trust."
      ],
      "id": "fb7mw9m"
    },
