      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Birsa Munda Hockey Stadium in Rourkela holds the Guinness World Record as the largest seated hockey stadium globally.",
        "Dutee Chand set the national record in the women's 100m sprint and represented Odisha at the Olympics.",
        "Questions frequently distinguish between the Biju Patnaik Sports Award (State Govt) and Ekalabya Puraskar (IMPaCT Trust)."
